# Personal ledger: plaintext is NEVER committed. Only the encrypted
# ledger.age (produced by ./sync.sh push) is tracked and pushed.
entries.jsonl
sessions/

# Per-user instance config (templates committed as *.example). Keeps the public
# repo generic and your profile/keys private.
profile.md
recipients.txt

# Safety net: never commit an age secret key, wherever it lands.
*age-key*
key.txt
*.key
